<title>NEW ZEALAND: RTRS-TABLE - NZ's FCL Group year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-TABLE - NZ's FCL Group year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-08-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated group net profit for year to June 30:</p>
<p>(million NZ$ unless otherwise )</p>
<p>					     Current	  Previous</p>
<p>					     period   corresponding period</p>
<p>     Net profit			    458		497</p>
<p>Note - Fletcher Challenge Ltd is the consolidated holding company of Fletcher Paper, Fletcher Energy, Fletcher Forests and Fletcher Building .</p>
<p>The net profit excludes abnormals, which included a $400 million provisional writedown of of the company's U.K. Paper division. Including abnormals, earnings were $166 million for the year to June 30, down from $490 million a year ago.</p>
